{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a baseline multimodal configuration combining PCA-encoded RNA data and ResNet50-encoded images via concatenation fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 score of 0.5104 suggest this approach achieves moderate performance, serving as an initial benchmark for multimodal integration. Uncertainty remains about its relative efficacy compared to single-modality baselines, as no direct comparisons have been made yet."
}

